[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3130120717","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3130120717","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3130120717,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66kdoN","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-28T23:29:25Z","updated_at":"2025-07-28T23:29:25Z","body":"The reason this clips is likely because the debug uses the same canvas item (parent).\n\nSo what needs to be done is to move the debug visuals to their own independent canvas item.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3130120717/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3132615239","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3132615239","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3132615239,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66t-pH","user":{"login":"DirtyDoggo","id":223270110,"node_id":"U_kgDODU7U3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223270110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo","html_url":"https://github.com/DirtyDoggo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T13:46:58Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T13:46:58Z","body":"Hello\n\nI tried to look into this as my first issue, and have realized that the same problem occurs with paths, raycasts, and probably all the nodes that have debug draw. This also happens when someone might override _draw() in gdscript for their own debug shapes.\n\nI am not sure forcing a separate canvas item for all of them is the ideal solution here, especially since custom scripting wouldn't have this as an available option (and from my coding experience, it seems like it could cause exceptions down the line).\n\nI considered just somehow forcing these 'debug draw only' nodes to not get added to canvas groups (which is what makes them crop), but then if someone would override the _draw() function on them, their draw would also draw outside of canvas groups, which wouldn't be ideal (canvas groups are already inconsistent in my experience, so I don't want to add more to it).\n\nSo my proposal for a fix is to somehow make a new draw function (or parameter) to draw something that will ignore the canvas group. It can then be used by all these debug drawing nodes, and could be exposed for script for others to use as well.\n\nUnless there is some other way to do this better?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3132615239/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3132796064","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3132796064","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3132796064,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66uqyg","user":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T14:25:17Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T14:25:17Z","body":"> ... have realized that the same problem occurs with paths, raycasts, and probably all the nodes that have debug draw.\n\nThere are likely many nodes that have the old way of doing debug rendering in 2D but e.g. NavigationRegion2D does not have this problem because it already uses its own canvas item for debug.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3132796064/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3132830362","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3132830362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3132830362,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66uzKa","user":{"login":"DirtyDoggo","id":223270110,"node_id":"U_kgDODU7U3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223270110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo","html_url":"https://github.com/DirtyDoggo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T14:30:43Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T14:30:43Z","body":"I see. So should I try set it up for all these debug draws that are missing, or just the collision shape? And maybe open separate issues for the others? Or all together?\n\nI don't know the procedures yet xD","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3132830362/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3132892260","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3132892260","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3132892260,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66vCRk","user":{"login":"DirtyDoggo","id":223270110,"node_id":"U_kgDODU7U3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223270110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo","html_url":"https://github.com/DirtyDoggo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-29T14:46:35Z","updated_at":"2025-07-29T15:03:46Z","body":"Actually, testing the NavigationRegion2D, due to the canvas item just floating disconnected as a separate layer, the debug draw is always drawn on top. So even if you want to put some sprite or something else on top of the nav region, it will still be shown under the debug polygon.\n\nAnd looking at the code for the solution applied to the NavRegion2D, it seems to be a lot more... raw than I expected. queue_redraw() now happen even when the whole node transform updates, which does not happen to other debug shapes. Here it is required with this custom canvas item needing a manual redraw due to being at the root of the tree (I assume). And there is a LOT of calculation happening when redraw occurs.\n\nI am not a fan of this solution, especially for more commonly used elements like collision shapes which may update transform a lot. It will potentially lead to performance hits, but also complicate the code needlessly.\n\nEDIT: Looked at the changes that brought to it, and I see that there is a separate mesh are being used for better draw performance (though there is also a canvas item the mesh draws onto) so maybe that's not that big an issue? It drawing over everything and adding complexity to the code does remain as a concern, especially if done to all the other debug drawing shapes.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3132892260/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136072576","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3136072576","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3136072576,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc667KuA","user":{"login":"DirtyDoggo","id":223270110,"node_id":"U_kgDODU7U3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223270110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo","html_url":"https://github.com/DirtyDoggo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T12:25:05Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T12:25:05Z","body":"Having had time to think about it, I think it would be best to just have an exposed bool in all canvas items that says 'exclude from parent canvas group' or similar, and have all the debug drawing nodes have it set to true by default.\n\nThat way of someone wants to script their own debug shapes, they will just have a dedicated child node to be used for debug draw of the parent.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136072576/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136323231","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3136323231","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3136323231,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc668H6f","user":{"login":"DirtyDoggo","id":223270110,"node_id":"U_kgDODU7U3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223270110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo","html_url":"https://github.com/DirtyDoggo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T13:17:25Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T13:17:25Z","body":"Regardless of the solution, I would like to give this issue a go for a fix.\n\nWould be nice to hear if my proposal makes sense or if I should take a different direction (I will try do it my way locally for practice anyway).","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3136323231/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137028874","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3137028874","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3137028874,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66-0MK","user":{"login":"DirtyDoggo","id":223270110,"node_id":"U_kgDODU7U3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223270110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo","html_url":"https://github.com/DirtyDoggo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T16:24:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T16:24:50Z","body":"After some testing, my approach seems impossible due to the fact canvas group rendering is entirely shader based, so there is no way to exclude children outside of unspeakable hacks.\n\nI had assumed there would be a way to exclude them from rendering and draw them on top of the group after, but the shader would not care about that.\n\nI guess making a canvas item as originally suggested is the only way to go with current architecture. But I will try to keep the z of the node at least.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137028874/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165345792","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3165345792","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3165345792,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68q1gA","user":{"login":"ezragoss","id":7423858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjM4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7423858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss","html_url":"https://github.com/ezragoss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T18:43:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T18:45:55Z","body":"I just read over the PR - doesn't it make more sense to embed a common debug canvas item in the shared base class? If the previous solution was already defaulting to `get_canvas_item` why not have a second `RID` member for `CanvasItem` called `debug_canvas_item` and refer to it for any debug drawing. This way this same fix for other nodes doesn't need to repeat the construction logic for a clearly shared problem","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165345792/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165497591","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3165497591","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3165497591,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68raj3","user":{"login":"DirtyDoggo","id":223270110,"node_id":"U_kgDODU7U3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223270110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo","html_url":"https://github.com/DirtyDoggo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T19:38:49Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T19:38:49Z","body":"Which shared class should it be added to? `Node2D`?\n\nAnd then just add a getter `get_debug_canvas_item` that will return the `RID` of it and generate it if it's the first time?\n\nIt would definitely be better, I just wasn't sure how far should I push adjusting surrounding classes, so I just kept it to the affected class.\n\nAlso, I notice that when Z updates, it doesn't seem to send any notifications? Is that intentional? It's not that Z is that big a deal, but I think it's still something to consider. Not that z will be perfect when the canvas group flattens the rest of the graphics.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165497591/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165528753","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3165528753","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3165528753,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68riKx","user":{"login":"DirtyDoggo","id":223270110,"node_id":"U_kgDODU7U3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223270110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo","html_url":"https://github.com/DirtyDoggo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T19:52:40Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T19:52:40Z","body":"Also, is procedure with stuff like this to make adding the debug canvas a PR on it's own? Or include it in the PR of this collision shape fix? And then have a separate issue for fixing it for all the other nodes?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165528753/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165551446","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3165551446","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3165551446,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68rntW","user":{"login":"ezragoss","id":7423858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjM4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7423858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss","html_url":"https://github.com/ezragoss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T20:02:26Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T20:08:05Z","body":"`CanvasItem` is where the current RID is stored so I would just do it alongside that\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a219a58ad050519a8a51b76f7f43e15accc577/scene/main/canvas_item.h#L78\n\nBecause `Node2D` ultimately inherits from `CanvasItem` this line: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a219a58ad050519a8a51b76f7f43e15accc577/scene/2d/physics/collision_shape_2d.cpp#L106\n\nwould just call the new `get_debug_canvas_item` instead. I imagine the construction and management of the debug canvas item would be similar to the non-debug","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165551446/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165558355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3165558355","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3165558355,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68rpZT","user":{"login":"ezragoss","id":7423858,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjM4NTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7423858?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss","html_url":"https://github.com/ezragoss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ezragoss/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T20:05:25Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T20:05:25Z","body":"I don't know the standard procedure and am also just starting out as a contributor to this project. If I were making this PR I would just put it all in one: the change to `CanvasItem` and the swapping out of that call for each of the relevant nodes. If I needed to break it up I would do one for the change to `CanvasItem` and one for swapping the call on each of the nodes. Either way reviewers will just have you break it up or consolidate if you do it wrong. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165558355/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165573790","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108800#issuecomment-3165573790","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108800","id":3165573790,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68rtKe","user":{"login":"DirtyDoggo","id":223270110,"node_id":"U_kgDODU7U3g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/223270110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DirtyDoggo","html_url":"htt